{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37739","headline":"送进士王驾下第归蒲中 · 郑谷","name":"送进士王驾下第归蒲中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"失意离愁春不知，到家时是落花时。\n孤单取事休言命，早晚逢人苦爱诗。\n度塞风沙归路远，傍河桑柘旧居移。\n应嗟我又巴江去，游子悠悠听子规。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37739.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37739","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}